The mobile hamburger navigation menu has been converted to the **Entire.io** editorial menu design:

### Implementation Details in [Header.jsx](file:///c:/Users/sahid/OneDrive/Desktop/git-explore/src/components/layouts/Header.jsx)
```jsx
<nav className="flex flex-col gap-6 sm:gap-7 my-auto">
  {navItems.map(({ label, to, tab, tag }, idx) => (
    <Link
      key={to}
      to={to}
      onClick={() => setIsMobileMenuOpen(false)}
      className="site-menu-item text-2xl sm:text-3xl px-2 font-sans transition-all duration-150 focus:outline-2 focus:-outline-offset-2 focus:outline-transparent focus:transition-none focus-visible:outline-focus flex items-center justify-between group text-white/70 hover:text-white"
      style={{ animationDelay: `${idx * 60}ms` }}
    >
      <span className="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-150 tracking-tight">
        {label}
      </span>
      {tag && (
        <span className="font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-zinc-200 bg-white/[0.05] border border-white/[0.08]">
          {tag}
        </span>
      )}
    </Link>
  ))}
</nav>
```

### Features
1. **Large Typography**: Clean `text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-sans tracking-tight` with `group-hover:translate-x-1` micro-interaction.
2. **Staggered Animation Delays**: Exact `animation-delay: 0ms`, `60ms`, `120ms`, `180ms`, etc., for sequential rendering.
3. **Use-Case Monospace Chips**: Sleek `font-mono text-xs` badges on the right (`Live Feed`, `Analytics`, `Saved`, `Heatmap & Stats`, `Handbook`, `Frontier AI`, `Feedback`).
4. **Clean Action Footer**: Includes the Entire.io solid-white **Return to Homepage** button and status indicators.

The build compiled successfully in **19.00s** with **0 errors**!

